  "prompt": "POV from inside a cramped, illuminated nylon tent, looking at the tent wall. Pressed against the outside of the tent fabric is the colossal body of a giant anaconda, so massive that the texture of its wet, glistening scales is clearly visible, stretching and deforming the thin nylon wall. The lantern inside the tent casts a terrifying, massive shadow of the anaconda's head onto the tent wall, its eye a dark, menacing void. Inside, the scene is chaotic: a flickering gas lantern, a rumpled sleeping bag, scattered scientific equipment, and a map. Outside, a torrential downpour in the dense Amazon rainforest at midnight. Authentic documentary style lighting, lit only by the single lantern source. Found footage style, caught-on-camera, hyperrealistic, terrifying moment of realization, sharp focus on the straining tent fabric. --ar 9:16",
